<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Adonis half yr earnings after tax slip.</title>
<headline>Adonis half yr earnings after tax slip.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31 1997.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - after tax	     15.1	  vs    21.9</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  3.0	  vs     6.0</p>
<p>    Retained income	432.00	 vs   564.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		  848.00	 vs 1,219.00</p>
<p>    Tax			310.00	 vs   442.00</p>
<p>    Interest received     35.00	 vs    87.00</p>
<p>    Turnover	     7,094.00	 vs 7,526.00</p>
<p>Div payable on August 12</p>
<p>on register July 11</p>
<p>Full name: Adonis Knitwear Holdings Limited</p>
<p>NOTE - The group expected turnover to improve significantly in the second half of the financial year. It forecast earnings for the full year to be at least at the same level as the last financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
